This is the latest version of GNU Chess.I've made quite a few modifications since the last versionwas posted (in December or January).  I've split the programinto two parts -- a chess engine and an interface section.  Thismay make it easier for people to customize an interface fortheir own needs.  I've included two interfaces, one is asimple alpha board display and another is for use in conjunctionwith Sun Chesstool or Xchess.  I may send alpha and graphicsinterfaces for MSDOS at a later date.  As far as chess abilitygoes this version is about 25% faster and has several newheuristics so it should play substantially better.John Stanbackjhs@hpltbm.HP.COMJune 1988